Next physical milestone: build one reclaimed-copper magnet/coil cartridge, demonstrate measurable charge from a controlled ambient-driven motion source, then combine it with two differently behaving sources through independent front ends. The first beautiful installation is built around verified mechanisms, not an imagined wattage claim.
Release checklist: publish photos, annotated drawings, materials passport, circuit or board schematic, firmware where used, BOM with substitutions, construction sequence, measured energy table, failures and revisions, maintenance instructions, and the provenance of significant reclaimed pieces.
---
15. Closing doctrine
Nothing burned to pretend energy appeared. Nothing discarded merely because it was old. No single small input dismissed because it was small.
G.E.R.A.L.D. takes apart a landfill. NEXERATH turns selected history into an elegant moving system. The system captures real energy from its surroundings and performs a real task. The visitors can see how it works, learn where its pieces came from, and build their own version.
> **It's not impossible. We just haven't built it yet.**
>
> **THE LANDFILL BECOMES THE CATHEDRAL.**
>
> **ART WITH A JOB. BEST BUILD WINS.**
